nchat-ui patch: send recordings as WhatsApp voice notes.

nchat sends any audio file as a plain AudioMessage, so a recording shows up on the other
side as an audio file. WhatsApp voice notes are AudioMessages with PTT=true, a duration and
a waveform. nchat-ui writes a sidecar "<file>.voicenote" (JSON: seconds + 64-value
waveform) next to each recording; when that sidecar exists, the message is sent as a voice
note. Other audio files are unchanged.

- voicenote.go (new): read the sidecar and set PTT, Seconds, Waveform, Opus mimetype.
- gowm.go: call it when building an AudioMessage.

Applied automatically by nchat-ui's build.rs; candidate for an upstream PR to nchat.
